OL,3,AEx-Kenyan governor jailed for 25 years
OL,4,Aover pregnant girlfriend's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Kenyan governor has been
OL,7,Fjailed for 25 years for the murder of a
OL,8,Funiversity student who was seven months
OL,9,Fpregnant with his child.
OL,11,FThe High Court on Friday sentenced
OL,12,FZacharia Okoth Obado, the former
OL,13,Fgovernor of Migori County, along with
OL,14,Ftwo former aides, over the 2018 killing
OL,15,Fof Sharon Belyne Otieno.
OL,17,FThe investigation established that an
OL,18,F"intimate relationship" had existed
OL,19,Fbetween Obado and Otieno, which
OL,20,F"subsequently led to a pregnancy with
OL,21,Fthe deceased that the governor was
OL,22,Funhappy about".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
