OL,3,AEx-Kenyan governor jailed for 25 years
OL,4,Aover pregnant girlfriend's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth Obado and Otieno's legal teams
OL,7,Fsaid they would appeal against the
OL,8,Fsentence.
